# RRAY (chief + 4 marginal rays), PRAY (8 pupil-ring rays), TPR (trace the found rays), FSR (the ray
# nearest a fractional source position) on the manual's Cassegrain with exit pupil (cmdref: Ray Tracing).
# Known gap, measured 2026-10-16 (PLAN_CONSOLIDATION 1.2): TPR prints RayPosHist, which is filled only
# when the deck declares SaveRayPosH= Y -- on an ordinary deck every position prints 0.  This journal
# pins the finders and that TPR runs; it does not assert TPR's numbers.
old $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/CassWithExitPupil.in
rray
tpr
pray
tpr
fsr
0.5,0
